{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2554a3dd-47b0-8547-9a42-f3856f1fc937",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T13:17:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter F. Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Please excuse me, I hope I am calling the correct office. I have a tree down at my house and I do not know who is supposed to take care of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you're in the right place to start. Where's the tree, is it on your property or out on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please let me explain. It is in my driveway. It fell from the wind, and now I cannot take my car out. It was the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. I found it Sunday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Sunday morning. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. It is 404 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-four Gibbs. Got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walter Lawton. Walter F. Lawton."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Lawton. So is the tree actually in your yard, like the trunk is growing on your lot? Or is it from the street side, or a neighbor's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, one moment. [pause] I am sorry, I have the television on low, it is a documentary about bridges. Let me turn it more down. Okay. The tree, I think, it grows in my yard, near the fence, but the top of it is across the driveway and a little on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And are there any wires on it or near it? Power line, cable, anything hanging?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please forgive me, I do not see well from the window. I think there is one wire, black, that is low, but I did not go close. I do not want to touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:14:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, don't go near it. If there's a wire down or touching the tree, that's the electric company, you'd call them first. They deal with anything live."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:14:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, so the utility takes the tree also? Or only the wire? This is what I am asking, who is responsible, the city, me, or the utility. Since Sunday nobody has told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, fair question. Generally the utility handles the wire and just the part of the tree that's touching it. If the tree's on your private property, clearing the rest is usually on the owner. The city takes care of trees in the street right-of-way, city-owned trees. The part over the sidewalk, we'd want to look at that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:15:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, I understand. But it is a little frustrating, because I have called nowhere yet, I did not know where. Where do I report a downed tree? Is there a number, or a website?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can report it right here, I can put in a request now. Tree is blocking the driveway and partly over the sidewalk, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:15:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. The driveway is completely blocked. My car cannot go out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm putting that down. Blocking driveway, over the sidewalk, possible wire, fell in the storm over the weekend. A crew or an inspector will go out and see whose tree it is. Crews are backed up after a storm like that, so it may not be today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, I understand they are busy. But it is already Wednesday. Three days it is there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I'll note it's been since Sunday. And I'd call the electric company today about that wire, so that's not sitting either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will call them. Excuse me, if the tree is mine, the city will not cut it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's all on your lot, probably not the trunk and the main part, that'd be you hiring a tree service. But the inspector can tell you what's what, and the piece over the sidewalk we'd look at. I don't want to tell you wrong on the exact line, so let them measure it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, may I give my telephone number for the call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-seven. That's good. Somebody should call you back to set up a look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, one more thing, if I hire a person for the tree, do I need to tell the city first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd wait for the inspector's call, then you'll know. Might save you paying for something the city covers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you for your help, Kevin. I hope it is soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it. Take care, Mr. Lawton."
    }
  ],
